    "body_text": "Skip Navigation\nRenton Municipal Code\nHelp Text Size: -A +A\n \n\n+ Advanced Search\n\nTitle I ADMINISTRATIVE\n  Contents\n\nClick the plus (+) or minus (-) symbols to expand or collapse the entries. Click the checkboxes to select sections for saving or printing.\n\nClear all\n\n+  Title I ADMINISTRATIVE\n\n+  Title II COMMISSIONS AND BOARDS\n\n+  Title III DEPARTMENTS AND OFFICERS\n\n+  Title IV DEVELOPMENT REGULATIONS\n\n+  Title V FINANCE AND BUSINESS REGULATIONS\n\n+  Title VI POLICE REGULATIONS\n\n–  Title VII FIRE REGULATIONS\n\n+  Title VIII HEALTH AND SANITATION\n\n+  Title IX PUBLIC WAYS AND PROPERTY\n\n+  Title X TRAFFIC\n\n+  Statutory References for Washington Cities and Towns\n\n–  Annexations\n\n–  Franchise List\n\n–  Local Improvement District\n\n–  Ordinance Table\n\n  \nTitle I\nADMINISTRATIVE\n\n1\n\n\t\n\nSeal    \n\n2\n\n\t\n\nOrdinances    \n\n3\n\n\t\n\nRemedies And Penalties    \n\n4\n\n\t\n\nMayor    \n\n5\n\n\t\n\nCouncil    \n\n6\n\n\t\n\nCode Of Ethics    \n\n7\n\n\t\n\nRepresentatives To Legislative And Administrative\nBodies    \n\n8\n\n\t\n\nHolidays    \n\n9\n\n\t\n\nDefense Of Employees, Officers And Volunteers    \n\n10\n\n\t\n\nCode Enforcement    \n\n  \n\nThe Renton Municipal Code is current through Ordinance 6197, passed August 10, 2026.\n\nDisclaimer: The City Clerk's Office has the official version of the Renton Municipal Code. Users should contact the City Clerk's Office for ordinances passed subsequent to the ordinance cited above.\n\nCity Website: https://rentonwa.gov/\nCity Telephone: (425) 430-6502\n\nCodification services provided by General Code\n\nMobile Version",
